{"word":"ἄθροισμα","uri":"athroisma","senses":[{"word":"ἄθροισμα","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἄθροισμα,</span></span> <span class=\"ital\">att.</span>\n<span class=\"es\">ἅθροισμα,</span> <span class=\"gens\">ατος</span>\n(<span class=\"grec\">τὸ</span>) ce qui est rassemblé, <span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> rassemblement,\nagglomération (de personnes, de peuple) <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Or.</span> <span class=\"refch\">874 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">d’où</span> assemblée de\nfidèles, église, <span class=\"aut\">Clém.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 444 Migne</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> réunion, cohésion (de\nchoses) <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Theæt.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">157</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span> ; <span class=\"ital\">dans la doctrine\népicurienne,</span> concours des atomes, <span class=\"aut\">DL.</span> <span class=\"refch\">8, 66</span>.</div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqetymor\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἀθροίζω</span>.</div>\n"}]}